{
  "bookId": "hero-213202",
  "id": "bond-29307",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29307001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "衣服已为您熨烫完毕。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "160℃的高温之下，每根纤维都将温和舒展，柔软贴身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "备好的红茶中加入了金桔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "甜醇与清香混合相融，更能助您开启新的一天。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "除此之外，行程也为您书写在了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等等。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "大人，是我哪里还做得不够好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，是有些……太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我担心这样下去，自己会不会变成贪吃懒做的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "大人，洛瑞丝是一个擅长让生活发生变化的管家哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "比如？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "为绝望麻木之人制造更深的困境，迫使他做出改变的决心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "为颓废不振之人制造短暂的希望，让他在落差里用破碎的身体重新爬起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "听起来有点吓人……我们还是讨论接下来行程的安排吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29307015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "呵呵，一切全都遵照您的旨意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
